      <description value="Consent justifying Emancipation. This emancipation is defined for just a year, using provision.period to indicate expiration; this is shown as example of renewal need. &#xD;&#xA;With this emancipation the father is allowed access to the Patient's data, but the mother is denied access to the Patient's data."/>
